    "html": "<p>On macOS, Linux, and Windows you can <a href=\"https://zed.dev/download\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">download Zed directly</a> or install Zed via your local package manager (<a href=\"https://zed.dev/docs/installation#macos\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">macOS</a>/<a href=\"https://zed.dev/docs/linux#installing-via-a-package-manager\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Linux</a>/<a href=\"https://zed.dev/docs/windows#package-managers\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Windows</a>).</p>\n<p>Other platforms are not yet available:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Web (<a href=\"https://github.com/zed-industries/zed/discussions/26195\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tracking discussion</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
